@MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5024

### 1. OpenAPI v1 Document
GET {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Submitted Request Articles (Excludes Author Drafts)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/requestarticle/List
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20,
  "SearchKeyword": null,
  "ArticleCategoryId": null,
  "AuthorId": null,
  "Status": null
}

### 3. Get Request Article Detail (With Staged Gallery Photos)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/requestarticle/Detail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000001"
}

### 4. Review Request Article (Approve -> Auto-Publishes to Tbl_Article)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/requestarticle/Review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000001",
  "Status": "Approved",
  "AdminNotes": "Approved for publication.",
  "IsFeatured": true,
  "IsSpotlight": false
}

### 5. List Published Articles (Tbl_Article)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/article/List
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20,
  "SearchKeyword": null,
  "ArticleCategoryId": null,
  "AuthorId": null,
  "Status": "Published",
  "IsFeatured": null,
  "IsSpotlight": null
}
